Here are all the components needed to build a variable power supply:

01. 220V to 16V Transformer (the 220V depends on the standard voltage of your country).
02. Full bridge rectifier.
03. 2200uF bipolar capacitor.
04. 2x 330nF capacitor.
05. 5x Diodes.
06. 500 Ohm resistor.
07. 400 Ohm resistor.
08. 1k Ohm resistor.
09. 6k Ohm potentiometer.
10. LM317T voltage regulator.
